<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.83 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.83 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 5.83 percent in the week ended June 7 from 5.93 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   June 7, 1997  May 31, 1997  June 8, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +5.83	   +5.93	   +4.52</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  323.2	   323.5	   305.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended June 8, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
